step
  when level<54
  zone map 1427
  task "Cross the bridge inside the pit. Go through the gate on the left and head north until you reach a large area with a captured archaeologist. A huge level 52 elite golem lies there (ignore it). Go up the iron ramp; about halfway there is a fork — keep going up. You'll find overseers paired with slavers. Further in, on the right, is Overseer Maltorius with his guards. They are 3 elites, so you can't solo them — find other players to do it together. Kill Maltorius: WANTED: Overseer Maltorius" optional
  collect 18946 quest 7701.1

